1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,116
The Quick slider.

2
00:00:01,156 --> 00:00:03,560
A volume and brightness track
that follows your finger.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,928
Turn on Advanced mode.

4
00:00:05,968 --> 00:00:09,038
The Quick slider comes with the Dock bar.

5
00:00:09,078 --> 00:00:13,360
Open Gesture Volume, switch
on Advanced mode and confirm.

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,425
Meet the Dock.

7
00:00:14,465 --> 00:00:18,960
Back on your home screen, the round button
is now the Dock: a slim tab on the edge.

8
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,935
Swipe the tab up or down.

9
00:00:20,975 --> 00:00:26,360
It grows into the Quick slider, and every
bit you swipe moves the level one step.

10
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,270
Touch the track to set it.

11
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:33,226
Touch anywhere on the open track: the
level jumps to your finger and follows it.

12
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:34,960
Let go and it tucks back in.

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,395
Or press a volume key.

14
00:00:36,435 --> 00:00:37,840
With Volume keys on Instant,

15
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:41,296
a key opens the slider on the spot
and moves it one step per press.

16
00:00:41,336 --> 00:00:43,360
Instant needs the accessibility service.

17
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,629
Open its settings.

18
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:47,914
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Quick slider.

19
00:00:47,954 --> 00:00:49,960
The preview runs your slider as it is.

20
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,267
Pick a fill.

21
00:00:51,307 --> 00:00:54,035
Open Animation and choose a fill.

22
00:00:54,075 --> 00:01:00,160
Shaders and Surge are live effects;
the preview at the top runs each one.

23
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,973
Celebrate at the top.

24
00:01:02,013 --> 00:01:07,375
With Celebrate at the top on, a flourish
plays when the level reaches 100%.

25
00:01:07,415 --> 00:01:08,960
Pick the one you like.

26
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:10,730
Choose what it adjusts.

27
00:01:10,770 --> 00:01:13,606
Under Content, pick
Brightness or one volume.

28
00:01:13,646 --> 00:01:17,760
Adaptive follows whatever is
playing: a call, an alarm, or media.

29
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:23,110
Up next: The Deck.
